  {
   "id": "no-skin-296046@major-2024-08-16",
   "gameId": "no-skin-296046",
   "displayName": "Demo Update",
   "kind": "major",
   "kindBasis": "studio",
   "announcedAt": "2024-08-16T10:35:59.000Z",
   "notes": [
    {
     "title": "Changes",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "The demo has been updated to version 0.5! This update primarily focuses on:",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "-QoL/Accessibility: Based on your feedback, accessibility has been improved (like the ability to rebind keyboard keys), and several mechanics have been enhanced (such as inventory management)",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": true,
       "category": "other",
       "platforms": [
        "pc"
       ]
      },
      {
       "text": "-Texts: A number of incorrect texts have been fixed, and new ones have been added or existing ones modified for better consistency",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "-Balancing: The game's balance has undergone significant changes. Many players complained that the difficulty was too low, and since it's already possible to lower the difficulty, I've decided to better balance the strategies that allowed for easy wins. In general, overpowered mechanics/items have been nerfed, and elements that were clearly weaker than other available options have been buffed. Feel free to share your thoughts on this balance—I believe there's still plenty of room for improvement!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "-And more???",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    }
   ],
